L106: The significant increase from baseline in mean of serum levels of all vitamins including vitamin A, vitamin B9, vitamin B12, vitamin C, vitamin D, and vitamin E were seen after 7 days of intervention. The effect size of treatment was significant between the study groups (ESs were 1.93, 1.01, 2.35, 2.26, 1.64, and 2.55, respectively;  p  < 0.001 for all comparisons) (Table  3 ).
